      "content": "{\n  \"newProducts\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"kimiflare\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/kimiflare\",\n      \"description\": \"Terminal-native coding agent running on Kimi K2.6 via Cloudflare Workers AI. Features multi-turn tool use, 262k context window, vision inputs support, and full agentic loop for code editing tasks directly in the CLI.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21T18:16:39.089-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"AI Coding Agent / CLI\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/kimiflare\",\n        \"https://github.com/trending\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"VibeAround\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/vibearound\",\n      \"description\": \"Tauri desktop application that enables chatting with local AI coding agents (including Claude Code, Gemini CLI, Codex CLI) from any instant messaging app or browser terminal. Bridges local CLI agents with popular communication platforms.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21T13:26:16.618-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"Workflow Tool / Vibe Coding Tools\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/vibearound\",\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Seeknal\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/seeknal\",\n      \"description\": \"All-in-one CLI for data & AI/ML engineering. Define pipelines in YAML/Python, run safe workflows, materialize data to PostgreSQL and Iceberg, and query data in natural language. Streamlines data engineering and ML operations.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21T09:02:50.256-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"CLI / Data & AI/ML Tool\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/seeknal\",\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Story Copilot\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/story-copilot\",\n      \"description\": \"Conversational AI interface to build intelligent workflows. Enables users to create and manage automated workflows through natural language conversation with an AI assistant.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21\",\n      \"category\": \"AI Workflow Automation / Workflow Tool\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Wrangle\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/wrangle\",\n      \"description\": \"Markdown editor that specifically understands and supports CLAUDE.md documentation format. Helps developers work with Claude Code's documentation structure more effectively.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21\",\n      \"category\": \"AI Code Editor / Developer Tool\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com\",\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/wrangle\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"EOL Dataset\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/eol-dataset\",\n      \"description\": \"Free tool to find every end-of-life dependency in your software stack in under 5 minutes. Tracks lifecycle status across 12M+ package versions using official EOL declarations and ML-based detection of maintainer abandonment. Supports all major ecosystems (npm, Maven, PyPI, NuGet, Go, Cargo).\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-09T12:50:32.779-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"Developer Tool / Security Tool\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/eol-dataset\",\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"FusedFrames\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fusedframes\",\n      \"description\": \"macOS application that captures team expertise to power AI agents. Uses AI to interpret actions in real-time, detect decisions requiring explanation, and distills them into structured patterns with triggers, steps, reasoning, and outcomes. Queryable by agents over API and CLI.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21T06:59:55.729-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"AI Workflow Automation / Knowledge Management\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/fusedframes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ml-intern\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ml-intern\",\n      \"description\": \"Hugging Face's open-source AI agent that fully automates ML post-training. Reads arXiv papers, fixes and creates datasets, runs training jobs, debugs failures, and iterates autonomously. Achieved +22 pts on GPQA in 10 hours and +60% on HealthBench. Available as CLI and web app.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-21T05:13:34.040-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"AI Coding Agent / ML Research Tool\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ml-intern\",\n        \"https://github.com/trending\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"KOS Protocol\",\n      \"url\": \"https://kosprotocol.dev\",\n      \"description\": \"A kos.json file standard for AI agents to read verified facts. Protocol for providing structured, verified information to AI agents, launched on Hacker News Show HN.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-24\",\n      \"category\": \"Developer Tool / Agent Infrastructure\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://news.ycombinator.com/newest\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"StarSinger MCP\",\n      \"url\": \"https://starsinger.ai\",\n      \"description\": \"Described as 'The Spotify for AI Agents' - an MCP (Model Context Protocol) tool for managing and integrating AI agents, launched on Hacker News Show HN.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2026-04-24\",\n      \"category\": \"Agent Infrastructure / MCP Tool\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://news.ycombinator.com/newest\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Wrangle (Legacy)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/wrangle\",\n      \"description\": \"Self-service cloud platform to clean, manipulate, and analyze data. Helps users spend less time in Excel by providing automated data cleaning and analysis tools. Note: Original launch from 2022, recently featured.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"2022-04-14T06:35:26.988-07:00\",\n      \"category\": \"Data Tool / SaaS\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://www.producthunt.com/products/wrangle\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"free-claude-code\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/Alishahryar1/free-claude-code\",\n      \"description\": \"Open-source project enabling use of claude-code for free in terminal, VSCode extension, or via Discord similar to openclaw. trending on GitHub with 7,777 stars and 2,640 stars today.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"Recent (trending 2026-04-24)\",\n      \"category\": \"AI Coding Agent / Open Source\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://github.com/trending\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"claude-context\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/zilliztech/claude-context\",\n      \"description\": \"Code search MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for Claude Code. Makes entire codebase available as context for any coding agent. 8,870 stars, 706 stars today on GitHub trending.\",\n      \"launchDate\": \"Recent (trending 2026-04-24)\",\n      \"category\": \"MCP Tool / Code Search\",\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"https://github.com/trending\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"whitelistUpdates\": [],\n  \"insights\": [\n    \"Major trend on April 21, 2026: Multiple AI coding/developer tools launched simultaneously on Product Hunt, including kimiflare, VibeAround, Seeknal, Story Copilot, Wrangle, FusedFrames, and ml-intern\",\n    \"Strong emergence of MCP (Model Context Protocol) ecosystem - tools like StarSinger MCP and claude-context are building infrastructure for agent communication\",\n    \"CLI-based AI coding tools are gaining traction - kimiflare, Seeknal, and free-claude-code all focus on terminal-native experiences\",\n    'Integration focus - VibeAround bridges local CLI agents with IM platforms, reflecting demand for \"vibe coding\" workflows',\n    \"Workflow automation remains key theme - FusedFrames captures team expertise, Story Copilot builds workflows conversationally\",\n    \"ML automation advancing - ml-intern from Hugging Face demonstrates fully automated post-training loops\",\n    \"Developer tooling for AI era - Wrangle supports CLAUDE.md, EOL Dataset addresses dependency lifecycle management\",\n    \"Open-source momentum - multiple projects (free-claude-code, claude-context, ml-intern) trending on GitHub with strong community engagement\"\n  ],\n  \"generatedAt\": \"2026-04-24T00:30:00.000Z\",\n  \"researchPeriod\": \"April 10-24, 2026\",\n  \"sources\": [\n    \"Product Hunt\",\n    \"Hacker News\",\n    \"GitHub Trending\"\n  ]\n}\n",
