tag\">performance</span>\n   601→                        </div>\n   602→                    </div>\n   603→\n   604→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   605→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   606→                            <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n   607→                            <a href=\"https://llm-stats.com/ai-news\" target=\"_blank\">LLM News Today (April 2026)</a>\n   608→                        </div>\n   609→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   610→                            Daily aggregation of AI model releases, benchmarks, and research. Covers GPQA, MMLU-Pro, AIME 2025, SWE-Bench Verified. Tracks 50+ benchmarks across 500+ models.\n   611→                        </div>\n   612→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   613→                            <span class=\"source-indicator\">llm-stats.com</span> · LLM Stats · April 21, 2026\n   614→                        </div>\n   615→                        <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 4px;\">\n   616→                            <span class=\"tag\">LLM benchmarks</span>\n   617→                            <span class=\"tag\">research</span>\n   618→                        </div>\n   619→                    </div>\n   620→\n   621→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   622→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   623→                            <span class=\"insight-type tutorial\">Tutorial</span>\n   624→                            <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CsNaJSTJGB4\" target=\"_blank\">AI Coding Models in 2026</a>\n   625→                        </div>\n   626→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   627→                            YouTube video covering AI coding models, security (6:53), implementing skills with LLMs and tasks, and TDD with LLMs.\n   628→                        </div>\n   629→                        <div class=\"item-meta\